          "voters_before": 3,
          "voters_after": 5,
          "isolation": "immediately after restart",
          "heal_settle_seconds": 8,
          "apply_timeout_seconds": 2
        }
      },
      "prefix": "The harness reuses the multi-voter scenario construction and the two-sided apply, then scans each side's log store for its own acknowledged entry, compares the two nodes' entries at the isolated side's last index, and emits logs_differ_at_conflict_index with the per-side log and FSM survival flags, the applied-without-log operands, and the leadership and acknowledgement outcomes. No production logic is modified.",
